"godotengine/godot-docs/workflows/build_offline_docs/master/godot-docs-"
"html-3.6.zip>`__. Extract the ZIP archive then open the top-level "
"``index.html`` in a web browser."
msgstr ""
"כדי לעיין בתיעוד במצב לא מקוון, אפשר להוריד עותק HTML (מתעדכן בכל יום שני): "
"`stable <https://nightly.link/godotengine/godot-docs/workflows/"
"build_offline_docs/master/godot-docs-html-stable.zip>`__, `latest <https://"
"nightly.link/godotengine/godot-docs/workflows/build_offline_docs/master/"
"godot-docs-html-master.zip>`__, `3.6 <https://nightly.link/godotengine/godot-"
"docs/workflows/build_offline_docs/master/godot-docs-html-3.6.zip>`__. יש "
"לחלץ את ארכיון ה־ZIP ואז לפתוח את הקובץ ``index.html`` שבתיקייה העליונה "
"בדפדפן אינטרנט."

#: ../../docs/index.rst:137
msgid ""
"For mobile devices or e-readers, you can also download an ePub copy (updated "
"every Monday): `stable <https://nightly.link/godotengine/godot-docs/"
"workflows/build_offline_docs/master/godot-docs-epub-stable.zip>`__, `latest "
