"מופיעות תחת הרשימה **Recent**."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/project_manager.rst:76
msgid "Opening and importing projects"
msgstr "פתיחה וייבוא של מיזמים"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/project_manager.rst:78
msgid ""
"The next time you open the Project Manager, you'll see your new project in "
