"\"always\", \"disabled\"]."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:160
msgid "**Debug options**"
msgstr "**אפשרויות ניפוי שגיאות**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:165
