msgstr "מזהה צוות Apple"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:136
msgid ""
"Team ID (\"Organization Unit\"), if your Apple ID belongs to multiple teams "
"(optional). [3]_"
msgstr ""
"מזהה צוות (\"Organization Unit\"), אם Apple ID שייך לכמה צוותים (אופציונלי). "
"[3]_"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:138
