"Properties that are part of groups all start with the same prefix "
"(``group_*``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:141
msgid ""
"Properties that are part of subgroups all start with the same prefix, which "
