#: ../../docs/engine_details/file_formats/tscn.rst:278
msgid ""
"For example, to refer to the resource ``[ext_resource type=\"Material\" "
"uid=\"uid://c4cp0al3ljsjv\" path=\"res://material.tres\" id=\"1_7bt6s\"]``, "
"you would use ``ExtResource(\"1_7bt6s\")``."
